The most recent version of the BMW 3 Series M340d is part of the G20/G21 generation, which received a facelift (LCI) for the 2023 model year. The M340d is an M Performance variant, offering a powerful diesel engine and sporty features, available in some markets (primarily Europe). This evaluation is based on the data found for the most recent M340d models.

